join Hope (Neutral) right
join Charity (Neutral) left
join Gogo (Neutral) left
Charity: This is the survey. It is part of the funded project — it is not a favour and nobody is being generous.
- Who arranged it?
	Hope: Who arranged it?
	Charity: The district. Because the ward put the need through the IDP, because this village put it to the ward.
	Charity: Which is to say: you are looking at eleven years of meetings, arriving in a bakkie.
Gogo: She wants to know where the spring was. I can tell her where the spring was.
- Should I come?
	Hope: Should I come?
	Gogo: Somebody has to carry the tripod. She has a bad back and I have a worse one.
set {GameState.quest_hydrogeologist_survey_escort} = "active"
[signal arg="objective:Walk the four survey sites with Gogo and Charity"]
set {GameState.village_beat_matched} = true
